#ASSERT `a reference to a Magistrate includes` `a Judge or acting Judge of the Local Court of the Northern Territory` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Scenario 289b (s 16BA): ... and not in "judge"
#ASSERT `a reference to a judge includes` `a Judge or acting Judge of the Local Court of the Northern Territory` EQUALS JUST FALSE
