-- Scenario 315 (s 19A(1) item 3): by describing a matter
#ASSERT `the Departments a reference means` `by describing a matter for which the Department is responsible` FALSE EQUALS LIST `the Department of State of the Commonwealth that deals with the relevant matter on the relevant day`
