#ASSERT `the time a reference to time in an Act means` NOTHING "legal time in Western Australia" EQUALS "legal time in Western Australia"
-- Scenario 561 (s 37): the Act specifically states Canberra time
#ASSERT `the time a reference to time in an Act means` (JUST "Canberra time") "legal time in Western Australia" EQUALS "Canberra time"
-- Scenario 562 (s 37): the same reference for a thing in Queensland
#ASSERT `the time a reference to time in an Act means` NOTHING "legal time in Queensland" EQUALS "legal time in Queensland"
